OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #1m awarded to climate
OL,4,Achange projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity projects tackling climate
OL,7,Fchange, including solar panels for an
OL,8,Farts centre, a bike recycling scheme
OL,9,Fand a repair cafe, have been handed
OL,10,Fgrants to support their work.
OL,12,FA total of #171,000 has been awarded by
OL,13,FSouth Cambridgeshire District Council
OL,14,Fto 14 groups. It means the local
OL,15,Fauthority has now given more than #1m
OL,16,Fto 110 projects since 2019.
OL,18,FWysing Arts Centre in Bourn will use
OL,19,Fits #15,000 to insulate and reglaze
OL,20,Fthree buildings used as artist studios,
OL,21,Flearning spaces and a recording studio.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
